  "description": "Currently in pre-release. Requires **LazyLib** and **LunaLib**. Safe to enable mid-save.\n\nInstall it via [**TriOS**](https://trilink.wispborne.com/open.html?mod=%7B\"url\"%3A\"https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FKlark-Morrigan%2FStarsector-Mod-KMU%2Freleases%2Flatest%2Fdownload%2Fkmu.version\"%2C\"id\"%3A\"kmu\"%7D&dep=%7B\"url\"%3A\"https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2FLazyWizard%2Flazylib%2Fmaster%2Fmod%2Flazylib.version\"%2C\"id\"%3A\"lw_lazylib\"%7D&dep=%7B\"url\"%3A\"https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2FLukas22041%2FLunaLib%2Fmain%2FLunaLib.version\"%2C\"id\"%3A\"lunalib\"%7D&dep=%7B\"url\"%3A\"https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FKlark-Morrigan%2FStarsector-Mod-KMLib%2Freleases%2Flatest%2Fdownload%2Fkmlib.version\"%2C\"id\"%3A\"kmlib\"%7D) or by downloading [**KMLib**](https://github.com/Klark-Morrigan/Starsector-Mod-KMLib/releases/latest) (its dependency) and [**KMU**](https://github.com/Klark-Morrigan/Starsector-Mod-KMU/releases/latest) (the mod itself).\n\nThe **Political Map** is the first among **Sector Map Layers** and focuses on populated colonies and their allegiances, with **Faction**, **Alliance**, and **Claim** views. It shows up primarily on the map screen and the intel screen, with a collapsible sidebar as its control interface.\n\nMade compatible with **Fast Rendering**, **Nexerelin** (alliances), **Random Assortment of Things** (minimap replacement).\n\nDiscuss in https://discord.com/channels/187635036525166592/1549091275167240272\nForum thread: https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=36029.0",
  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Currently in pre-release. Requires **LazyLib** and **LunaLib**. Safe to enable mid-save.</p><p>Install it via [**TriOS**](<a href=\"https://trilink.wispborne.com/open.html?mod=%7B\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://trilink.wispborne.com/open.html?mod=%7B</a>\"url\"%3A\"https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FKlark-Morrigan%2FStarsector-Mod-KMU%2Freleases%2Flatest%2Fdownload%2Fkmu.version\"%2C\"id\"%3A\"kmu\"%7D&amp;dep=%7B\"url\"%3A\"https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2FLazyWizard%2Flazylib%2Fmaster%2Fmod%2Flazylib.version\"%2C\"id\"%3A\"lw_lazylib\"%7D&amp;dep=%7B\"url\"%3A\"https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2FLukas22041%2FLunaLib%2Fmain%2FLunaLib.version\"%2C\"id\"%3A\"lunalib\"%7D&amp;dep=%7B\"url\"%3A\"https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FKlark-Morrigan%2FStarsector-Mod-KMLib%2Freleases%2Flatest%2Fdownload%2Fkmlib.version\"%2C\"id\"%3A\"kmlib\"%7D) or by downloading [**KMLib**](<a href=\"https://github.com/Klark-Morrigan/Starsector-Mod-KMLib/releases/latest\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/Klark-Morrigan/Starsector-Mod-KMLib/releases/latest</a>) (its dependency) and [**KMU**](<a href=\"https://github.com/Klark-Morrigan/Starsector-Mod-KMU/releases/latest\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/Klark-Morrigan/Starsector-Mod-KMU/releases/latest</a>) (the mod itself).</p><p>The **Political Map** is the first among **Sector Map Layers** and focuses on populated colonies and their allegiances, with **Faction**, **Alliance**, and **Claim** views. It shows up primarily on the map screen and the intel screen, with a collapsible sidebar as its control interface.</p><p>Made compatible with **Fast Rendering**, **Nexerelin** (alliances), **Random Assortment of Things** (minimap replacement).</p><p>Discuss in <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/187635036525166592/1549091275167240272\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://discord.com/channels/187635036525166592/1549091275167240272</a><br>Forum thread: <a href=\"https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=36029.0\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=36029.0</a></p>",
